      "widgets_values": [
        "[Static camera, locked-down shot] A photorealistic naked-eye 3D anamorphic billboard advertisement on a busy Seoul street corner. The massive L-shaped wrap-around billboard structure, the building facade, surrounding architecture, and all urban structures remain completely frozen and immobile throughout the entire sequence. The scene transitions naturally and seamlessly from the start frame to the end frame.\n[Product Emergence] The luxury perfume bottle, initially displayed deep within the billboard screen in a flat advertisement context, gradually surges forward with lifelike fluid motion. It appears to physically break through the screen surface, emerging from the billboard display area and projecting outward into real space toward the viewer. The perfume bottle strictly originates and exits only from within the billboard screen boundaries. The frame of the billboard and all surrounding structural elements remain perfectly static at all times.\n[Advertisement Background] The background environment inside the billboard screen (abstract 3D space, floating elements, lighting effects) may animate naturally and dynamically to enhance the depth illusion.\n[Street Scene] The pedestrians and vehicles on the street below move naturally with realistic motion blur, creating a vivid contrast between the kinetic city life and the frozen architectural frame. Buses, taxis, and cars flow through traffic lanes with motion trails. People on sidewalks move with natural blur streaks.\n[Visual Style] Cinematic anamorphic lens, high-contrast commercial lighting, sharp product textures, photorealistic 8k, deep spatial depth, premium brand aesthetic."
